'''Manga Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] and is only found in the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch]] version of [[The Battle Cats]]. He comes from Manya Immortal Nosuke's "Manga! The Battle Cats" and was put out as promotional material for the CoroCoro Magazine Monthly January 2024 Issue. Manga Cat would be obtained from a trading card containing a serial code in which the player could redeem and obtain said unit. As of December 15, 2023, Manga Cat is ''<u>only</u>'' obtainable in the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') version.

