==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Manga Popo Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Identical to [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] in terms of usage albeit with Special rarity instead of Normal. Due to its expendable nature, Manga Cat can be deployed en masse as a wave of meatshields for your main attackers or crowd controllers. While it may succeed in its role, it is just as easily replaceable as all the other cheap meatshields available the player naturally obtains throughout the game. Though unlike most Cat clones, Manga Cat does not have any major caveat that would render it weaker than its original counterpart.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

