==Trivia==
* Manga Cat is based off the manga version of [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] who is one of the main characters in the manga series made by Manya Immortal Nosuke (萬屋不死身之介先生) which is published under CoroCoro Comic.
*Manga Cat currently stands with the longest gap between release of new content for the Nintendo Switch version, having a span of 1,248 days since the release of [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Versus Mode|Versus Mode]].
*It, [[Manga Boogie Cat (Switch Special Cat)|Manga Boogie Cat]], [[Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat (Switch Special Cat)|Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat]], and [[Nora (Special Cat)|Nora]] are units based off main characters from manga they each originate from.

